tched_at, received_at, status FROM shipments WHERE sales_order_id='SO20260814-0189'\\\" && echo \\\"=== consistency ===\\\" && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT status, SUM(CASE WHEN received_at IS NULL OR received_at='' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) null_recv, SUM(CASE WHEN received_at IS NOT NULL AND received_at<>'' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) has_recv, COUNT(*) FROM shipments GROUP BY status\\\" && echo \\\"=== unsigned orders ===\\\" && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT sales_order_id) FROM shipments WHERE received_at IS NULL OR received_at='' OR status<>'已签收'\\\" && echo \\\"=== shipments on non-effective orders ===\\\" && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT COUNT(*) FROM shipments sh WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM v_current_orders o WHERE o.sales_order_id=sh.sales_order_id)\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:00:10.657530", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_407159b0cc6f4d6194785114", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "shipment_id | sales_order_id | quantity | unit | dispatched_at | received_at | status\n----------------------------------------\nSH-MO20260814-0189-1 | SO20260814-0189 | 1 | 件 | 2026-09-15T08:00:00+08:00 |  | 在途\n(1 rows)\n=== consistency ===\nstatus | null_recv | has_recv | COUNT(*)\n----------------------------------------\n在途 | 22 | 0 | 22\n已签收 | 0 | 724 | 724\n(2 rows)\n=== unsigned orders ===\nCOUNT(DISTINCT sales_order_id)\n----------------------------------------\n22\n(1 rows)\n=== shipments on non-effective orders ===\nCOUNT(*)\n----------------------------------------\n0\n(1 rows)", "id": "8422f1e4f08343c6a875c84bfaa511b3", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:00:13.787972", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:00:13.789271", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "Clean data:\n- 746 shipments, 724 已签收 (all have received_at), 22 在途 (all null received_at), belonging to 22 distinct orders.\n- 702 effective orders have shipments; 680 have all batches signed; 22 have at least one 在途 batch.\n- 67 effective orders have no shipment at all.\n\nSo answer: 680 单 fully signed out of 769 effective orders (88.4%).\n\nLet me also double check the max received_at ≤ snapshot (data hygiene) and give the final SQL. Also verify that among the 680, quantity-wise full: signed_qty >= order quantity — yes 680.\n\nLet me also produce a breakdown: single-batch fully signed vs multi-batch fully signed. And check whether any of the 44 two-batch orders are fully signed.\n\nAlso verify snapshot_at value.\n\nLet me run one final verification query with breakdown.", "id": "1b87fa6aad034a118d041e27afc7e4c8", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:00:41.492089", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_f0a2ed32b0df40c285558c5e", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd datahub && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT config_key, config_value FROM configuration\\\" && echo \\\"=== breakdown ===\\\" && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"\\nWITH s AS (\\n  SELECT sales_order_id, COUNT(*) batches,\\n         SUM(CASE WHEN status='已签收' AND received_at IS NOT NULL AND received_at<>'' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) signed_batches,\\n         MAX(received_at) last_signed_at\\n  FROM shipments GROUP BY sales_order_id)\\nSELECT s.batches, COUNT(*) orders_all_signed\\nFROM v_current_orders o JOIN s ON s.sales_order_id=o.sales_order_id\\nWHERE s.signed_batches=s.batches\\nGROUP BY s.batches\\\" && echo \\\"=== late sign check ===\\\" && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT COUNT(*) FROM shipments WHERE received_at > (SELECT config_value FROM configuration WHERE config_key='snapshot_at')\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:00:45.383446", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_f0a2ed32b0df40c285558c5e", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "config_key | config_value\n----------------