s; run against agent_data.sqlite (read-only recommended).\n-- 1. Effective orders. Future examples are excluded.\nSELECT sales_order_id, work_order_id, customer_id, product_id, quantity, unit, promised_delivery_at\nFROM v_current_orders\nLIMIT 20;\n\n-- 2. Stock at warehouse / lot / item grain. Signed quantities are already normalized.\nSELECT warehouse_id,lot_id,material_id,product_id,\n       ROUND(SUM(signed_quantity),6) AS balance\nFROM wms_transactions\nGROUP BY warehouse_id,lot_id,material_id,product_id\nORDER BY warehouse_id,lot_id;\n\n-- 3. Observe schema before choosing columns and JOIN keys.\nPRAGMA table_info(stage_nodes);\nPRAGMA table_info(shipments);\nPRAGMA foreign_key_list(work_orders);\n\n-- Do not join multiple fact tables directly and then SUM.\n-- Aggregate labor, warehouse movements and freight separately to sales_order_id first.", "id": "4cd89191af4c4eee9967cca00fb33102", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:59:06.345418", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:59:06.346866", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "有视图 v_current_orders。让我查视图列表。\n\n数据规模：800 订单行（=800 sales_order_id，1:1），769 已生效。单位有 台/套/件/批。\n\n现在计算全量签收：按 sales_order_id 汇总 shipments 中 received_at IS NOT NULL 的 quantity，与 orders.quantity 比较。注意单位一致性 — 检查 shipments.unit 与 orders.unit 是否一致。\n\n还要注意防放大：shipments 是事实表，先按 sales_order_id 预聚合再关联。\n\n另外要看是否有异常：shipments 数量超过订单数量的情况、单位不一致的情况 → 人工复核清单。\n\n还有 logistics_events 表可能也有签收事件，需要看口径用哪个。字段字典说 shipments.received_at 是签收时间。让我检查 logistics_events 是否有签收类型事件，避免遗漏。", "id": "41a25c480a6949f6aa20fdadad46a605", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:59:08.050630", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_58d4b46b55314aed86b546cf", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT name, sql FROM sqlite_master WHERE type='view'\\\" 2>&1 | head -40\\necho \\\"=== logistics_events schema ===\\\"\\npython3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"PRA